Output ../src/assets/recordings/tui-browse.webp

Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Padding 16
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "mcp-tui --cmd npx --args '@modelcontextprotocol/server-everything,stdio'"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 4s

Right
Sleep 700ms
Right
Sleep 700ms
Right
Sleep 700ms
Left
Sleep 700ms
Down
Sleep 500ms
Down
Sleep 500ms
Down
Sleep 500ms
Up
Sleep 500ms
Sleep 1s
